*.iml
.gradle
.kotlin
/local.properties
/.idea/
# T07: a small, reviewed set of .idea files expresses project intent and is shared on
# purpose: the project name, the Gradle and compiler settings, the inspection profile,
# and the VCS mappings (the last is required for the opus/libopusenc/ogg submodules to be
# seen as separate VCS roots). Everything else under .idea is IDE-local state and is
# ignored. Negations must come after the /.idea/ rule to have any effect.
/!.idea/.gitignore
/!.idea/.name
/!.idea/AndroidProjectSystem.xml
/!.idea/compiler.xml
/!.idea/gradle.xml
/!.idea/inspectionProfiles/
/!.idea/vcs.xml
.DS_Store
/build
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
local.properties
key.jks
key_base64.txt
/app/.project
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
# Local tool state and build logs: machine specific, never part of the project.
build_run.log
/.freebuff/
__pycache__/
